    <bpmn:process id="W_W4097" name="W4097. Technology Business Management (TBM) Framework &amp; Cost Taxonomy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program stand-up; annual framework refresh
Frequency: Maintained + annual
Volume: Enterprise technology spend (≈ PHP 0.6B–1.9B/yr across 5 entities)
Owner: FinOps Lead / CIO Office
Participants: CFO (links to VS-17.4), CIO (VS-27), EA (VS-113), ITAM (VS-99), Finance (VS-17)
Source: workflow W4097 — Technology Business Management (TBM) Framework &amp; Cost Taxonomy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4097_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4097_Lane1" name="FinOps Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4097_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4097_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4097_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4097_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4097_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4097_Start3" name="Program stand-up; annual framework refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4097_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4097_Task4" name="FinOps Lead establish the TBM cost taxonomy (infrastructure, application…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FinOps Lead establish the TBM cost taxonomy (infrastructure, application, cloud/SaaS, telco/network, vendor services, people) mapped to business units, capabilities, and the application portfolio (VS-113)
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / EA / ITAM
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4097_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4097_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4097_Task5" name="FinOps Lead map all technology spend into the taxonomy (incl. interentity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: FinOps Lead map all technology spend into the taxonomy (incl. interentity allocation links to VS-72), define the cost-to-serve metrics, and align to the GL/COA (links to VS-17/VS-29)
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4097_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4097_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4097_Task6" name="FinOps Lead publish the TBM framework, onboard new spend, and review annually…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: FinOps Lead publish the TBM framework, onboard new spend, and review annually with Finance and the executive team
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead
Accountable (A): CFO / CIO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4097_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4097_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4097_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4097_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4097_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-635 (ensure controlled execution — Technology Investment Planning, Budgeting &amp; TBM Framework (PA-135.1).) | - CTL-635: TBM taxonomy approved by CFO/CIO; reconciliation to GL monthly
Owner: FinOps Lead / CIO Office</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4097_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4097_Annotation8" targetRef="W4097_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
