    <bpmn:process id="W_W4098" name="W4098. Annual IT Budget Planning, Zero-Based &amp; Capacity-Based Budgeting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget cycle; reforecast
Frequency: Annual + quarterly reforecast
Volume: Enterprise technology budget (run vs grow vs transform)
Owner: FinOps Lead / CIO
Participants: Finance (VS-17.4), CIO office, function sponsors, EA (VS-113), OpEx (VS-133)
Source: workflow W4098 — Annual IT Budget Planning, Zero-Based &amp; Capacity-Based Budgeting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4098_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4098_Lane1" name="FinOps Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4098_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4098_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4098_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4098_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4098_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4098_Start3" name="Annual budget cycle; reforecast">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4098_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4098_Task4" name="FinOps Lead/CIO build the annual IT budget (run-the-business, grow, transform)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FinOps Lead/CIO build the annual IT budget (run-the-business, grow, transform), with zero-based review of discretionary lines and capacity-based modeling for usage-driven cloud/SaaS/telco
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / CIO Office / EA
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4098_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4098_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4098_Task5" name="FinOps Lead align the budget to the investment portfolio (W4099) and corporate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: FinOps Lead align the budget to the investment portfolio (W4099) and corporate FP&amp;A (VS-17.4/VS-33), and reforecast quarterly against actuals (W4117)
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4098_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4098_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4098_Task6" name="FinOps Lead present the budget to the executive/Board (VS-36), manage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: FinOps Lead present the budget to the executive/Board (VS-36), manage trade-offs, and cascade accountability to budget owners
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / CIO
Accountable (A): CFO / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4098_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4098_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4098_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4098_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4098_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-635 (ensure controlled execution — Technology Investment Planning, Budgeting &amp; TBM Framework (PA-135.1).) | - CTL-635: budget approved by CFO/Board; variance reviewed quarterly
Owner: FinOps Lead / CIO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
