        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-635 (ensure controlled execution — Technology Investment Planning, Budgeting &amp; TBM Framework (PA-135.1).) | - CTL-635: capex/opex classification reviewed by Finance; investment approval per authority matrix (VS-40)
Owner: FinOps Lead / CIO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
