    <bpmn:process id="W_W4100" name="W4100. Business Case, TCO &amp; ROI Modeling for Technology Initiatives" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Investment proposal; major initiative
Frequency: Per initiative
Volume: Per technology initiative
Owner: FinOps Lead / Sponsor
Participants: Finance (VS-17.4), sponsor, EA (VS-113), ITAM (VS-99), OpEx benefit (VS-133 W4065)
Source: workflow W4100 — Business Case, TCO &amp; ROI Modeling for Technology Initiatives</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4100_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4100_Lane1" name="FinOps Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4100_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4100_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4100_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4100_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4100_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4100_Start3" name="Investment proposal; major initiative">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4100_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4100_Task4" name="FinOps Lead build the TCO (license/subscription, cloud, integration…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FinOps Lead build the TCO (license/subscription, cloud, integration, implementation, support, telco, end-of-life) and the benefit case (revenue, cost, risk, productivity) with Finance sign-off
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): Sponsor / CFO
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4100_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4100_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4100_Task5" name="FinOps Lead model ROI/NPV/payback, test sensitivity, and document…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: FinOps Lead model ROI/NPV/payback, test sensitivity, and document assumptions/risks; align benefit tracking to VS-133 W4065
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / OpEx
Accountable (A): Sponsor
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4100_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4100_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4100_Task6" name="FinOps Lead track realized TCO/ROI against the case post-implementation (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: FinOps Lead track realized TCO/ROI against the case post-implementation (links to W4113), and feed lessons into future cases
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Post-implementation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4100_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4100_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4100_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4100_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
